<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>NØRTH — Streetwear</title>
<meta name="description" content="NØRTH — независимый streetwear-бренд. Минимализм, свобода и характер.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Onest:wght@400;500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="header" id="header">
  <a href="#hero" class="logo">NØRTH</a>
  <nav class="nav" id="nav" aria-label="Главное меню">
    <a href="#hero">Главная</a>
    <a href="#collection">Коллекция</a>
    <a href="#about">О бренде</a>
    <a href="#contacts">Контакты</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="head-actions">
    <button class="cart" id="cartButton" aria-label="Открыть корзину">КОРЗИНА <span id="cartCount">0</span></button>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Меню" aria-expanded="false"><i></i><i></i></button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>
  <section class="hero" id="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="hero-small">AUTUMN / WINTER 2026</p>
      <h1><span>MOVE</span><span>DIFFERENT.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">Минималистичная одежда для тех, кто создаёт собственный путь.</p>
      <a href="#collection" class="hero-button">СМОТРЕТЬ КОЛЛЕКЦИЮ →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-hint">SCROLL ↓</div>
  </section>

  <div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="track">
    <span>NO RULES</span><span>✕</span><span>NO LIMITS</span><span>✕</span><span>MOVE DIFFERENT</span><span>✕</span>
    <span>NO RULES</span><span>✕</span><span>NO LIMITS</span><span>✕</span><span>MOVE DIFFERENT</span><span>✕</span>
  </div></div>

  <section class="collection reveal" id="collection">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div><p class="section-label">NØRTH / 01</p><h2>NEW COLLECTION</h2></div>
      <a href="#collection" class="view-all">VIEW ALL →</a>
    </div>

    <div class="products">
      <article class="product" data-id="hoodie" data-name="OVERSIZED HOODIE" data-price="7490">
        <div class="product-image"><span class="badge">NEW</span>
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551488831-00ddcb6c6bd3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Oversized hoodie" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="product-info"><h3>OVERSIZED HOODIE</h3><p>7 490 ₽</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="product" data-id="tee" data-name="NØRTH T-SHIRT" data-price="4290">
        <div class="product-image">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523381210434-271e8be1f52b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="NØRTH T-shirt" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="product-info"><h3>NØRTH T-SHIRT</h3><p>4 290 ₽</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="product" data-id="pants" data-name="WIDE PANTS" data-price="6990">
        <div class="product-image"><span class="badge">NEW</span>
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542272604-787c3835535d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Wide pants" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="product-info"><h3>WIDE PANTS</h3><p>6 990 ₽</p></div>
      </article>
      <article class="product" data-id="basic" data-name="BASIC T-SHIRT" data-price="3490">
        <div class="product-image">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521572163474-6864f9cf17ab?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Basic T-shirt" loading="lazy"></div>
        <div class="product-info"><h3>BASIC T-SHIRT</h3><p>3 490 ₽</p></div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about reveal" id="about">
    <div class="about-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529139574466-a303027c1d8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85" alt="NØRTH brand" loading="lazy"></div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <p class="section-label">NØRTH / 02</p>
      <h2>NO RULES.<br>NO LIMITS.</h2>
      <p class="about-text">NØRTH — независимый streetwear-бренд, созданный для людей, которые не хотят следовать чужим правилам.</p>
      <p class="about-text">Мы создаём вещи, которые можно носить каждый день и сочетать по-своему. Минимализм, свобода и характер — основа каждой коллекции.</p>
      <div class="stats"><div><b>2021</b><span>основан</span></div><div><b>40+</b><span>вещей в базовой линейке</span></div><div><b>100%</b><span>хлопок</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="footer reveal" id="contacts">
  <div class="footer-top">
    <div class="footer-brand"><div class="footer-logo">NØRTH</div><p>MOVE DIFFERENT.</p></div>
    <div class="footer-column"><h4>SHOP</h4><a href="#collection">New Collection</a><a href="#collection">Hoodies</a><a href="#collection">T-Shirts</a><a href="#collection">Pants</a></div>
    <div class="footer-column"><h4>INFO</h4><a href="#about">О бренде</a><a href="#contacts">Доставка</a><a href="#contacts">Возврат</a><a href="#contacts">Контакты</a></div>
    <div class="footer-column"><h4>SOCIAL</h4><a href="#contacts">Instagram</a><a href="#contacts">Telegram</a><a href="#contacts">VK</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 NØRTH</span><span>MADE FOR DIFFERENT PEOPLE</span></div>
</footer>

<div class="overlay" id="overlay"></div>
<aside class="drawer" id="drawer" aria-label="Корзина" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="drawer-head"><h3>КОРЗИНА</h3><button id="closeCart" aria-label="Закрыть">✕</button></div>
  <ul class="cart-list" id="cartList"></ul>
  <div class="drawer-foot">
    <div class="total"><span>ИТОГО</span><b id="cartTotal">0 ₽</b></div>
    <button class="checkout" id="checkout">ОФОРМИТЬ ЗАКАЗ</button>
    <p class="ship" id="ship"></p>
  </div>
</aside>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div>

<script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
